WEBVTT

00:08:26.445 --> 00:08:32.506
is just a smidge too much responsibility
to put on one fragile, human psyche.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.021
It's like asking somebody
to swallow the sun.

00:08:36.045 --> 00:08:38.672
It just completely warps
and distorts egos,

00:08:38.696 --> 00:08:42.222
and it creates all these unmanageable
expectations about performance.

00:08:42.246 --> 00:08:44.221
And I think the pressure of that

00:08:44.245 --> 00:08:47.438
has been killing off our artists
for the last 500 years.

00:08:47.462 --> 00:08:50.103
And, if this is true,

00:08:50.127 --> 00:08:51.689
and I think it is true,

00:08:51.713 --> 00:08:54.554
the question becomes, what now?

00:08:54.578 --> 00:08:56.423
Can we do this differently?

00:08:56.447 --> 00:08:59.819
Maybe go back to some more
ancient understanding

00:08:59.843 --> 00:09:04.320
about the relationship between humans
and the creative mystery.